---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Page not found
permalink: /404.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
description: "That address does not exist on LRACDIMENSION."
---
<section class="shell portfolio-section page-intro not-found">
  <p class="overline">404 / Not found</p>
  <h1>Nothing at<br>this address.</h1>
  <p>The page may have moved when the site was reorganised into dimensions, or the link was mistyped. Everything that exists is one step away.</p>
  <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/">Home ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="/vector/">Examine a website ↗</a></div>
</section>
<section class="shell portfolio-section">
  <p class="overline">Dimensions</p>
  <ol class="dim-grid" aria-label="Dimensions">{% for d in dimensions %}<li class="dim-card" data-status="{{ d.status }}"><a href="{{ d.href }}" class="dim-card__link"><span class="dim-card__index">{{ d.index }}</span><span class="dim-card__name">{{ d.name | upper }}</span><span class="dim-card__descriptor">{{ d.descriptor }}</span></a></li>{% endfor %}</ol>
</section>
